---
/**
 * Hand-authored diagram of the six-step brokered signup flow.
 *
 * Terminal rules: ASCII labels, 1px geometry, no icons, no gradients, no
 * shadows, no radius, tokens only. The vertical stack keeps the labels legible
 * at 375px without horizontal scrolling, so there is one layout rather than a
 * separate mobile variant. The viewBox matches the narrowest rendered width
 * (about 318px), so text is never scaled below its authored size on a phone.
 *
 * Not normative. The contract is `agent-identity-protocol` in the specification; this
 * figure is an orientation aid and repeats the numbered legend on the page.
 */
---

<figure class="my-6 border border-line bg-surface px-3 py-4">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 318 408"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="handshake-diagram-title"
    aria-describedby="handshake-diagram-desc"
    class="mx-auto block h-auto w-full"
    style="max-width: 24rem;"
  >
    <title id="handshake-diagram-title">Brokered signup flow between the human owner, the agent, the broker, and the provider</title>
    <desc id="handshake-diagram-desc">
      Numbered six-step flow. Step 1, human: sign in with GitHub, verify your
      email address, and sign the master delegation agreement. Step 2, agent:
      connect to the broker MCP endpoint and pick or create an agent during
      browser OAuth consent. Step 3, broker: identity_signup fetches provider
      discovery and terms, hashes exact bytes, emails a copy to the human owner,
      and mints a five-minute signed JWT. Step 4, agent: POST the prepared
      signup_request to the provider with Authorization Bearer. Step 5,
      provider: verify the JWT against JWKS, create or resolve the account, and
      return a signed receipt plus an optional guide link. Step 6, broker:
      identity_record_signup records the receipt in the human owner's /activity
      audit trail. Three trust boundaries are marked: human consent after step
      1, broker minting after step 3, and provider verification after step 5.
    </desc>

    <g fill="var(--color-foreground)">
      <!-- 1 -->
      <rect x="2" y="8" width="314" height="48" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-line)" />
      <text x="6" y="17" font-size="11" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-muted)">HUMAN</text>
      <text x="6" y="44" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-accent)">1</text>
      <text x="52" y="26" font-size="11">sign in with GitHub, verify email and</text>
      <text x="52" y="42" font-size="11">sign the master delegation agreement</text>

      <!-- boundary: human consent -->
      <text x="2" y="70" font-size="11" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-warn)">TRUST BOUNDARY - HUMAN CONSENT</text>
      <line x1="2" y1="76" x2="316" y2="76" stroke="var(--color-line-strong)" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />

      <!-- 2 -->
      <rect x="2" y="80" width="314" height="48" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-line)" />
      <text x="6" y="89" font-size="11" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-muted)">AGENT</text>
      <text x="6" y="116" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-accent)">2</text>
      <text x="52" y="98" font-size="11">connect /mcp and bind or create an</text>
      <text x="52" y="114" font-size="11">agent in browser OAuth consent</text>

      <!-- 3 -->
      <rect x="2" y="136" width="314" height="48" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-line)" />
      <text x="6" y="145" font-size="11" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-muted)">BROKER</text>
      <text x="6" y="172" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-accent)">3</text>
      <text x="52" y="154" font-size="11">identity_signup: fetch terms, hash</text>
      <text x="52" y="170" font-size="11">bytes, email copy, mint 5-min JWT</text>

      <!-- boundary: broker minting -->
      <text x="2" y="206" font-size="11" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-warn)">TRUST BOUNDARY - BROKER MINTING</text>
      <line x1="2" y1="212" x2="316" y2="212" stroke="var(--color-line-strong)" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />

      <!-- 4 -->
      <rect x="2" y="216" width="314" height="48" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-line)" />
      <text x="6" y="225" font-size="11" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-muted)">AGENT</text>
      <text x="6" y="252" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-accent)">4</text>
      <text x="52" y="234" font-size="11">POST prepared signup_request to the</text>
      <text x="52" y="250" font-size="11">provider with Authorization: Bearer</text>

      <!-- 5 -->
      <rect x="2" y="272" width="314" height="48" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-line)" />
      <text x="6" y="281" font-size="11" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-muted)">PROVIDER</text>
      <text x="6" y="308" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-accent)">5</text>
      <text x="52" y="290" font-size="11">verify JWT via JWKS, create or resolve</text>
      <text x="52" y="306" font-size="11">account, return receipt + guide link</text>

      <!-- boundary: provider verification -->
      <text x="2" y="342" font-size="11" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-warn)">TRUST BOUNDARY - PROVIDER VERIFICATION</text>
      <line x1="2" y1="348" x2="316" y2="348" stroke="var(--color-line-strong)" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />

      <!-- 6 -->
      <rect x="2" y="352" width="314" height="48" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-line)" />
      <text x="6" y="361" font-size="11" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-muted)">BROKER</text>
      <text x="6" y="388" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-accent)">6</text>
      <text x="52" y="370" font-size="11">identity_record_signup records the</text>
      <text x="52" y="386" font-size="11">receipt in your /activity audit trail</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption class="mt-3 text-xs text-faint">
    Hand-authored, not normative. The contract is the specification; this figure is an orientation aid.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  svg text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
</style>
